  "decision_conditions": [
    "By reason of its siting on a prominent corner plot, scale, form, bulk and massing, the proposed single storey side extension would fail to appear as a subordinate or proportionate addition to the host dwelling, would have an incongruous appearance owing to its poor design and roof light, resulting in an unacceptable harm to the character and appearance of the host dwelling and wider area  and would be contrary to policy D3 of the London Plan 2021 and policy DM10 of the LDF Core Strategy 2012.\r"
